Section: mail
Priority: optional
Enhances: postfix
Description: Python daemon template with SMTP policy support
 PyPolicyd is a Python daemon template with SMTP policy functionality for Postfix.
 It provides rate limiting, size controls, and configurable rules for email delivery.
 .
 Features:
  - SMTP policy daemon for Postfix integration
  - Rate limiting with multiple time windows
  - User and domain-specific policies  
  - SQLite database for state persistence
  - Systemd integration with security restrictions
  - Configurable logging and monitoring
